WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.850
A new technology cuts the
cost of making solar panels.

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.790
Two students are asked
to graph what happens.

3
00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:08.320
They draw the same curves,

4
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.460
the same shift, and get the same answer.

5
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.610
One graph earns every point.

6
00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.410
The other can lose every graph point.

7
00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:19.130
So what separates a graph
that earns full marks

8
00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:22.070
from one that looks
right but scores nothing?

9
00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:25.320
In this mission, you'll
build the graph step by step,

10
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:28.200
from blank axes to the new equilibrium.

11
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.850
Then you'll hunt down the
mistakes that quietly cost points,

12
00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.250
one at a time.

13
00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:37.560
Your mission: find out exactly
what earns the points on a graph.
